OL,3,GNEWSAPainting of chased wartime ferry
OL,4,Aup for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA painting of a Humber passenger
OL,7,Fsteamship involved in a sea drama
OL,8,Fduring World War One is to be auctioned
OL,9,Fafter being discovered during a house
OL,10,Fclearance in Grimsby.
OL,12,FAuctioneers John Taylors said the
OL,13,Fpainting depicted the SS Wrexham, a
OL,14,FHumber ferry which was pursued by a
OL,15,FGerman submarine while heading to the
OL,16,Fcontinent.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
