OL,3,GNEWSAPainting of chased wartime ferry
OL,4,Aup for auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe captain of the vessel, James
OL,7,FFryatt, refused to stop when ordered by
OL,8,Fthe Germans and the submarine chased
OL,9,Fthe ship to Rotterdam. The Germans
OL,10,Fcaught Fryatt three months later and
OL,11,Fshot him.
OL,13,FThe painting of the SS Wrexham by Dutch
OL,14,Fmarine artist Alfred Jansen goes under
OL,15,Fthe hammer at the auction rooms in
OL,16,FLouth at 10:00 BST on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
